  "name": "storybook-tools",
  "description": "Install and bind a suite of generic Storybook「Tools」pages into any React + Vite Storybook project. Current tools: the Component Coverage Analyzer (UI-image/PRD-to-coverage-report workflow with dev API vite plugin, check scripts, and companion analyze/implement skills) and the Component Timeline (git-derived component birth dates joined with the catalog, with live story previews). Copies the bundled template per tool, generates a project-specific component catalog by reading the target project's components and stories, wires .storybook/main.ts and check scripts, and verifies the installation. Installs all tools by default or a named subset; also handles updating a previously installed copy, including legacy single-tool (component-coverage-only) installations. Use when the user wants the Storybook tools suite, the component coverage tool or analyzer, the component timeline page, or an existing installation upgraded to the latest template.",
